WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.500
It’s Professor Dave, let’s surf the net.

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:14.200
We live in modern times, as is evidenced by
the fact that you’re probably watching this

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:19.340
on a computer, tablet, or smart phone, or
something even more advanced, if you’re

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:22.660
watching this decades after I’ve spoken
these words.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:27.480
For this reason, we may want to learn a little
bit of vocabulary regarding computers and

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:31.710
the virtual world, or il mondo virtuale.

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:36.750
The word for computer is simply taken from
English and pronounced as best as Italians

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:41.740
can muster, as they have difficulty ending
words with consonant sounds.

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:09.720
That may not be everything you could ever
need to say regarding a computer or the internet,

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:14.400
but it’s a pretty good start, so make sure
to cliccare the next clip!

